<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Stalk</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Assassin (guild level 22)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>stalk &lt;person&gt;
</pre>
<p>Follows someone without their knowing: wherever they go, you go after 
them (see <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>). To stop, follow yourself.
</p><p>If it goes well, you silently begin to stalk them, and they don't notice. 
If it goes less well, you still follow them, but they notice you begin to 
stalk them. If it goes badly, you fail miserably, in front of everyone, 
and don't follow at all. Your dexterity and brain decide it, against your 
quarry's watchfulness. You must be standing.
</p><p>Stalking is best paired with sneaking (see <a cmd='#'>Help Sneak</a>), so that your 
quarry doesn't see you arrive after them either.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sneak</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Assassin Skills</a>
</pre>




</div>